    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Ngemva kokufaka imininingwane yakho, ungakwazi kalula ukulungisa iphasiwedi yakho ngokulandela izinyathelo esizithumela.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
