    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Le khodi enezinombolo ezi-8 iyenzelwe ukuxhuma ne-Apple HomeKit futhi isebenza kuphela nohlelo lokusebenza lwe-Apple Home. Uma idivayisi isekela i-API yendawo efana ne-Shelly, WLED noma i-Tasmota, ungayifaka kuthungela lwakho lwendawo.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Le Divayisi", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Le khodi ye-QR ingeyenethiwekhi ye-Wi-Fi, hhayi idivayisi. Ngemva kokuxhuma idivayisi kunethiwekhi efanayo, ungayifaka kusuka kunethiwekhi yakho yendawo.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Akukho idivayisi ye-NEXUS eyaziwayo etholwe kuleli kheli. Qiniseka ukuthi idivayisi ivuliwe futhi ikwi-netiweki efanayo.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
