    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Kugcinwe kule nyanga", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Akukho divayisi esekelwe etholwe kule nethiwekhi.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Akukho divayisi esekelwe etholwe kule nethiwekhi. Qiniseka ukuthi idivayisi ivuliwe futhi ixhunywe ku-Wi-Fi efanayo; kungenjalo sebenzisa ikhathalogu engezansi noma ikhodi ye-QR / yokusetha.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Ukuvikelwa kwendawo kwale divayisi", // EN: Local protection for this device
