    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Amadivayisi owengeze kule ndlu abhalwe lapha.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Amadivayisi owengeze kule ndlu abhalwe lapha futhi axhunyiwe kumakhadi owathandayo.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa ngokuqinile le ndlu kanye nazo zonke izilungiselelo zayo?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Leli khodi alikho ikhodi yedivayisi esekelwa. Uma wazi ikheli le-IP ledivayisi, ungayifaka ku-inthanethi yakho yendawo.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Lawa mabhulogi alawulwa ngenethiwekhi yakho yendawo.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Le mini app ihlinzekwa ngumhlinzeki osemthethweni.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
