    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Uma lesi simo siyasetshenziswa, amadivayisi ahlobene alungiswa ngokuzenzakalelayo.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Azikho izinsiza ezithintekayo kulesi simo \u2014 faka isisetshenziswa esifanele kuqala.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Udinga ukufaka isisetshenziswa esihambisanayo ukuze usebenzise lesi simo.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
