    "S\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle, yeni s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc buradan kontrol et ve y\u00fckle.": "Buka inguqulo, hlola inguqulo entsha lapha futhi uyifake.", // EN: View the version, check for a new version here and install it.
