    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Cisha wonke amaqembu okukhanyisa asasekhaya.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "Endlini Naphandle", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Phandle", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Lapho uphume", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Phatha izibani egumbini lakho lasekhaya ngokulandelana okukodwa. Vula/vala, ukukhanya, izinga lokushisa kombala nezinqamuleli zesigcawu esheshayo kuhlelo olulodwa.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Nikeza imiyalo esheshayo, izenzakalo ezisheshayo kanye neziphakamiso zohlelo lokusebenza ezihlakaniphile ezisuselwe kumadivayisi akuyo ekhaya.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Dala uhlelo lokusebenza lokunethezeka kwesimo sezulu oluphatha ama-AC namathamo ema-thermostat ekhaya lakho kusuka kuphaneli elilodwa. Faka ukulawula izinga lokushisa, izindlela ezisheshayo, imodi ye-eco nezenzo ezisekelwe egumbini.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Iyini isimo samadivayisi ami?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "Ukukude Nekhaya", // EN: Away from Home
    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "Isigcawu Sokuqeda Umsebenzi Uma Ukude Nekhaya", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Sihlanganisa ukuhlolwa kwamandla nokuphepha lapho ushiya ikhaya.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "Ukukude ekhaya", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Ukuhamba Ekhaya", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Ukuhamba Ekhaya Hlola", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Isigcawu Sokuhamba Ekhaya", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Isifinyezo Sokuhamba Ekhaya", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Qeda ukuhamba ekhaya", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Dala uhlelo lokusebenza lokuhlola ukuhamba ekhaya olukhombisa amadivayisi asashisiwe, isimo lokukhiya namasethingi wamandla kusikrini esisodwa. Faka izinkinobho zokucisha ngokushesha nokuvula ukuphepha.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Hlola amadivayisi asashisiwe, izikhiye nesimo samandla kuwo wonke uchungechunge lapho ushiya ikhaya.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Khombisa amadivayisi asashiywe evuliwe, izicabha zivaliwe kanye nesimo samandla kusikrini esisodwa uma ushiya ikhaya.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Bona amalambu, amathuluzi kagesi, ama-AC nezilungiselelo zokuphepha ezisele zivuliwe ngaphambi kokushiya ikhaya, esipanelini esisodwa. Qoqa izinyathelo zokucisha ngokushesha nokuvula ukuphepha kube nokugeleza okukodwa.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Ake senze izihlolo zokugcina ngaphambi kokuthi uphume.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Cisha amalambu ngokuzenzakalelayo emva kokushiya...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Cisha amalambu ngokuzenzakalelayo emva kokushiya ikhaya", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Cisha amalambu ngokuzenzakalelayo lapho ushiya bese ukuvulela uma ubuya.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Cisha umoya-mpilo (air conditioner) ngokuzenzakalelayo uma kungekho muntu ekhaya futhi ugweme ukusetshenziswa okungenangqondo.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Sika amandla kumadivayisi agcinwe esimweni sokulinda ngokuzenzakalelayo ngaleso sikhathi okhethe kuso ebusuku.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Uma ushiya ikhaya", // EN: When leaving home
