    "Eve yakla\u015f\u0131rken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7, klimay\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve garaj kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131n ekran\u0131ndan kontrol et.": "Vula izibani, qala i-AC futhi ulawule umnyango we-garaji esikrinini semoto yakho njengoba usondela ekhaya.", // EN: Turn on the lights, start the AC and control the garage door from your car's screen as you approach home.
    "Evet, Uygula": "Yebo, Faka isicelo", // EN: Yes, Apply
    "Evet, \u0130ptal Et": "Yebo, Khansela", // EN: Yes, Cancel
    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "Yebo. I-NEXUS ibeka kuqala indawo yendawo; idatha yedivayisi yakho ihlala kule divayisi futhi ayabelwanga kwabanye abantu.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
