    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "Alikho khona okwazwayo kule viki. Ukuboniswa nemisindo kuhlangana lapha.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
    "Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f listesi, ev i\u015fleri ya da k\u0131sa notlar \u2014 ailenle payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk maddeyi ekle.": "Uhlu lokuthenga, imisebenzi noma amanothi asheshayo \u2014 engeza into yokuqala ukuze wabelane nomndeni wakho.", // EN: Shopping list, chores or quick notes — add the first item to share with your family.
