    "Kamera, kilit ve sens\u00f6rleri tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir ev g\u00fcvenlik merkezi olu\u015ftur. Evdeyim ve d\u0131\u015far\u0131day\u0131m modlar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 kontrol butonlar\u0131 ve kritik durum \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Dala isikhungo sokuphepha sasekhaya esibonisa amakhamera, izivalo nezinzwa esikrinini esisodwa. Faka izindlela zokuba ekhaya nangaphandle, izinkinobho zokulawula ngokushesha kanye nezifinyezo zesimo esibucayi.", // EN: Create a home security center that shows cameras, locks and sensors on one screen. Add at-home and away modes, quick control buttons and critical status summaries.
