    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Kukhona idivayisi kuleli ikheli, kodwa ayikhulumi nge-NEXUS protocol.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Le divayisi isivele yengeziwe.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Hlanganisa Futhi Faka", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Ikhodi yokuhlanganisa ayivumelekile. Faka ikhodi enamadijithi angama-11 noma okuqukethwe kwe-QR okuqala nge-MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Faka le khodi kuhlelo lokusebenza lwe-NEXUS kudeskithophu. Uma idivayisi isikwi-Wi-Fi, ungayifaka futhi kunethiwekhi yakini ngokusebenzisa ikheli layo le-IP.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Kuseshwa idivayisi kunethiwekhi efanayo bese ihlangene. Lokhu kungathatha kuze kube umzuzu; idivayisi kumele ivuliwe futhi ibe kwimodi yokuhlangana.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Idivayisi ayitholakali noma ayikwazanga ukuhlanganiswa. Qinisekisa ukuthi isekuyo inethiwekhi efanayo, ivuliwe futhi isesimweni sokuhlanganisa.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Idivayisi ayitholakali. Qinisekisa ukuthi isekuyo inethiwekhi efanayo, ivuliwe futhi isesimweni sokuhlanganisa. I-firewall yekhompyutha yakho ingase ivimbele izimpendulo ezivela kumadivayisi anethiwekhi yasendaweni.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Idivayisi ayikwazanga ukuhlanganiswa. Hlola ikhodi yokuhlanganisa nokuthi idivayisi isesimweni sokuhlanganisa.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Idivayisi ihlanganisiwe kodwa ayinayo imisebenzi i-NEXUS engayilawula.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Idivayisi ayiphendulanga. Qinisekisa ukuthi ivuliwe futhi isekuyo inethiwekhi efanayo.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
