    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Iphaneli yokuzijabulisa ngenkinobho eyodwa kuma-TV nasemadivayisini wezindaba.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
