    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Hlanganisa zonke izilungiselelo zasekhaya ozidingayo ngaphambi kokulala endaweni eyodwa. Nciphisa ukukhanya, ungaphazanyiswa, hlola ukuvimbela nokulungiselela isimo sezulu sokulala kusikrini esisodwa.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Dala isikhungo sokulungiselela ubusuku sokulala esiphatha izibani, imodi yokuthula, ukuvala izicabha kanye nesimo sezulu ngaphambi kokulala. Faka isifinyezo sokuhlola sokugcina kanye nemodi yasemini ngomunwe owodwa.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
