    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Vula leli khasi kuhlelo lokusebenza lwe-NEXUS ku-iPhone yakho; izimo zakho zibhalwe ngezansi futhi ungahlela i-shortcut ye-Siri ngayinye.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Kopisha isixhumanisi sesimo", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Lesi sixhumanisi sivula i-NEXUS futhi siqhube isimo ngokushesha.", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
    "2. Kestirmeler'de yeni kestirme olu\u015ftur": "2. Dala i-shortcut entsha ku-Shortcuts", // EN: 2. Create a new shortcut in Shortcuts
