    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Uma isenzi somnyango/efasitela sivuleka", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Uma isethi yomlilo, isikhukhula noma igesi ikhweza isexwayiso", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Izinto ezibangela amadivayisi nama-sensor zizovela lapha uma ungeze idivayisi efanele.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
