    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "Vula amakhethini", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Vala iminyango", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Ivula zonke izibani ngobukhulu obugcwele.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Ivula zonke izibani.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Ivula izibani ngobukhulu obugcwele ngombala wokukhanya kwelanga.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Isetha izibani ku-85% ngombala ovamile bese icisha i-TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Isetha izibani ku-40% ngombala oshisayo.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Njalo kusihlwa ngo-19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Vula i-AC ku-20\u00b0 bese usetha i-thermostat ku-20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Setha i-thermostat kusethwa kokunethezeka okungu-24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Ezinsukwini zomsebenzi ngo-06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Vula wonke amakhethini nama-blind.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Nsuku zonke lapho ilanga liyakhanya", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Vala wonke amakhethini nama-blind.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Nsuku zonke lapho ilanga lishona", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Vala wonke amakhiye ahlakaniphile (amakhiyi awavulwa nhlobo).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Vala izibani ne-TV; shiya izintambo ne-AC zingashintshi.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Vula noma vala idivayisi", // EN: Turn a device on or off
