    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Khetha idivayisi ofuna ukuyilawula.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Bona ikhwalithi yomoya, izinga lokushisa kanye nokuminyanisa okuphelele okuhlolwa yizinzwa zakho, futhi ulawule i-purifier yakho.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Lungisa izibani, amakhethini ne-AC usuku lonke ngokuqhafaza okukodwa.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Vula izibani, amakhethini kanye nesimo sezulu ndawonye uma ukufika ekhaya.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Faka amadivayisi akho esimweni esiphephile, esisindisa amandla ngenkathi ungakhona isikhathi eside.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Nciphisa ukukhanya, vala amaslayidi bese uvula i-TV.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Qalisa i-robot vacuum yakho noma uyibuyisele emgodini wayo.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Vala umnyango, vala amaslayidi bese ulungisa indlu ubusuku bonke.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Bona isimo nezilungiselelo zobumfihlo zamakhamera akho kwisikrini esisodwa.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Vula noma vala imodi yobumfihlo yamakhamera akho endaweni eyodwa ngenkathi usekhaya.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Bona ukuthi yikuphi ukuzilawula okukhiye okwenziwa namuhla.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Yabelana ngezincwadi nemisebenzi nabahlali bendlu yakho.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
