    "\u015eifreyi Kaydet": "Gcina Iphasiwedi", // EN: Save Password
    "Google ile giri\u015f \u015fu anda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor. E-posta ve \u015fifreyle giri\u015f yap; Google ile hesap a\u00e7t\u0131ysan \u201c\u015eifremi Unuttum\u201d ile bir \u015fifre belirleyebilirsin.": "Ukungena nge-Google akutholakali okwamanje. Ngena ngemvume nge-imeyili nephasiwedi; uma udale i-akhawunti yakho nge-Google, sebenzisa \u201cUkhohlwe Iphasiwedi\u201d ukusetha iphasiwedi.", // EN: Google sign-in isn't available right now. Sign in with email and password; if you created your account with Google, use “Forgot Password” to set a password.
