    "\u0130ptal ve \u00f6deme y\u00f6ntemi de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi g\u00fcvenli \u00f6deme sayfam\u0131z Whop \u00fczerinden yap\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ptal edersen mevcut d\u00f6nemin sonuna kadar kullanmaya devam edersin ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "Ukukhansela nokushintsha indlela yakho yokukhokha kwenzeka ekhasini lethu eliphephile lokukhokha, i-Whop. Uma ukhansele, uyaqhubeka usebenzisa i-NEXUS+ kuze kube sekupheleni kwesikhathi samanje futhi inkokhelo elandelayo ayiyathathwa.", // EN: Cancelling and changing your payment method happen on our secure checkout page, Whop. If you cancel, you keep using NEXUS+ until the end of the current period and the next payment is never taken.
    "Aboneli\u011fin yok. NEXUS+ i\u00e7in Plus sayfas\u0131ndan \u00fccretsiz deneyebilirsin.": "Awunayo insizakalo yokubhalisela. Zama i-NEXUS+ mahhala ekhasini le-Plus.", // EN: You don't have a subscription. Try NEXUS+ free from the Plus page.
    "QR, kurulum kodu veya manuel katalog ile ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Amadivayisi owengeza nge-QR, ikhodi yokusetha noma ikhalenda elenziwa ngesandla azokhonjiswa lapha.", // EN: Devices you add by QR, setup code or the manual catalog show up here.
