    "Ortam sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, \u0131\u015f\u0131k, durum": "Iphaneli yomtshina ojwayelekile \u00b7 izinga lokushisa, ukukhanya, isimo", // EN: Ambient sensor panel · temperature, light, status
