    "Anahtar kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat": "Iphaneli yokulawula isitshi \u00b7 vula, vala", // EN: Switch control panel · on, off
    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Leli gama liboniswa ekhadini lasekhaya nasekufakweni kwemishini.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
