    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "Iphasiwedi yakho isimiswe \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Leli akhawunti lavulwa nge-Google futhi lisenakho ukufaka iphasiwedi okwamanje. Setha iphasiwedi yakho yokuqala lapha; emva kwalokho ungakwazi futhi ukungena nge-imeyili nephasiwedi.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Thumela kimi isixhumanisi sokusetha iphasiwedi", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "Lesi senzo sidinga ukuqinisekiswa okwengeziwe. Ungacela isixhumanisi sokusetha iphasiwedi ngezansi.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Isixhumanisi sokusetha iphasiwedi sithunyelwe kwebhokisi lakho leposi \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "Isixhumanisi sephasiwedi asikwazi ukuthunyelwa njengamanje.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Asikwazanga ukuthola i-imeyili yakho yokungena; qala ungene kuqala.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "Isixhumanisi asikwazi ukuthunyelwa. Zama futhi emzuzwini.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
