    "I added \"{0}\" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.": "Ngifake i-\"{0}\" ku-Tap to Run; ukuchofoza okukodwa kulungisa amadivayisi {1}.", // EN: I added "{0}" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.
